            { c: "  useful corollary:  log_b a x log_a b = 1", w: "" },
            { c: "", w: "" },
            { c: "Values worth carrying:  log10(2) = 0.3010, log10(3) = 0.4771", w: "" },
            { c: "  and so log10(5) = 1 - 0.3010 = 0.6990", w: "5 = 10/2, so its log is 1 minus log 2. Never memorised separately.", hi: true }
