          sol: { lang: "text", code: "(a) sums 9,10,11,12 have 4+3+2+1 = 10 ways\n    10/36 = 5/18\n\n(b) 6C3 / 10C3 = 20/120 = 1/6\n    (or 6/10 x 5/9 x 4/8 = 120/720 = 1/6)\n\n(c) 1 - P(no heads) = 1 - 1/8 = 7/8\n\n(d) 4/52 + 13/52 - 1/52 = 16/52 = 4/13" },
