          hint: "Count the downgraders: *first*, *couple*, *small*, *maybe*, *just*, *when you get a chance*, *no rush*.",
          sol: { lang: "text", code: "Actual message:  The methodology section has a real problem and needs\n                 rewriting before this goes anywhere.\n\nWhat to do:      Rewrite it properly, this week - and confirm the level\n                 explicitly rather than guessing:\n\n  \"Before I redo it - is the methodology section a rewrite or a tidy-up?\n   Happy either way, I would just rather do it once.\"\n\nThat question is polite, takes ten seconds, and removes the ambiguity\nentirely. It is also completely normal to ask." },
