    tag: "S3 permissions",
    lvl: "hardcore",
    q: "Your policy grants `s3:GetObject` and `s3:ListBucket` on `arn:aws:s3:::my-docs/*`. Reading a file works; listing the bucket returns AccessDenied. Why?",
